{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTE: This game is only supported by Meta Quest VR Headsets &amp; Valve Index</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439970/extras/e89c3839d61c4b629e179e0308d0a55c.poster.avif?t=1757597652\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439970/extras/e89c3839d61c4b629e179e0308d0a55c.webm?t=1757597652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439970/extras/e89c3839d61c4b629e179e0308d0a55c.mp4?t=1757597652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a mysterious facility where something strange lurks in the dark. Bring your friend, because you will not survive alone.<br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock abilities to discover the true extent of the facility's secrets. Discover more about the invisible creatures that won\u2019t leave you to do your work. Decode the symbols and solve puzzles that block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439970/extras/79a44be52c3c4ebd48992fa5de5b9462.poster.avif?t=1757597652\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439970/extras/79a44be52c3c4ebd48992fa5de5b9462.webm?t=1757597652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439970/extras/79a44be52c3c4ebd48992fa5de5b9462.mp4?t=1757597652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comm